---
import ComputerLayout from "../layouts/ComputerLayout.astro";
import DosCommandForm from "../components/DosCommandForm.astro";
import HomeFallbackLink from "../components/HomeFallbackLink.astro";
---

<ComputerLayout
  title="Hephaestus | Sanshray's Portfolio"
  description="Hephaestus is a story-driven spaceflight game with a custom C++ physics engine."
>
  <article class="terminal-page">
    <p class="terminal-prompt">C:\PORTFOLIO\PROJECTS&gt; type hephaestus.txt</p>
    <h1>Hephaestus</h1>

    <p>
      Hephaestus is a story-based spaceflight game born from my interest in
      spaceflight and the space race of the 1960s. I built its physics engine in
      C++, which gives me an opportunity to learn advanced C++ techniques,
      rocket science, and orbital mechanics.
    </p>

    <p>
      The publicly available code contains the physics engine and software that
      renders a scaled model of the solar system using Unreal Engine. The rest
      of the game's software will remain closed source while I develop
      Hephaestus into a complete game.
    </p>

    <div class="resource-block">
      <p>STATUS: IN DEVELOPMENT</p>
      <p>TECHNOLOGIES: C++ // UNREAL ENGINE // JSON // DOCKER</p>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/Sansh-M/Hephaestus"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">[ OPEN GITHUB REPOSITORY ]</a
      >
    </div>

    <DosCommandForm
      prompt="C:\\PORTFOLIO\\PROJECTS\\HEPHAESTUS>"
      autofocus={true}
    />
    <HomeFallbackLink />
  </article>
</ComputerLayout>
